@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Lab 3: CRUD Operations Overview";
}

<div class="page-hero hero-blue">
    <div class="hero-badges">
        <span class="step-pill pill-teal">@Model.ModuleName</span>
        <span class="step-pill">Student Starter</span>
    </div>
    <h1>@Model.LabTitle</h1>
    <p class="lead">
        Welcome to your starter project for <strong>Lab 3</strong>! In this lab, you will extend your ASP.NET Core Razor Pages application by implementing full <strong>CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete)</strong> operations using Entity Framework Core and SQLite. You will build HTML input forms, handle HTTP POST requests, validate user input with Data Annotations, enforce safe data deletion workflows, and apply the Post-Redirect-Get (PRG) pattern with TempData user feedback.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
        <a asp-page="/Staff/Index" class="btn btn-primary">Go to Staff Directory &rarr;</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/mustbebuilt/razor-lab3-cruding/wiki" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">
            📖 Open Wiki Tutorial Guide
        </a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="alert alert-checklist">
    <div class="checklist-title">
        <span>🚀</span>
        <span>Quick Start Checklist for Students</span>
    </div>
    <div class="checklist">
        <ol>
            <li>
                <strong>Review the PRG Pattern &amp; CRUD Overview:</strong> Follow Step 01 in the Wiki to understand HTTP GET vs POST workflows, inspect the starter code, and master the Post-Redirect-Get design pattern.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Implement Record Creation (Step 02):</strong> Build <code>Pages/Staff/Create.cshtml</code>, use <code>asp-for</code> Tag Helpers, handle <code>OnPostAsync()</code>, and insert records into SQLite with <code>_context.Staff.Add()</code>.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Add Form Validation (Step 03):</strong> Apply Data Annotations (<code>[Required]</code>, <code>[EmailAddress]</code>, <code>[Range]</code>) in <code>Models/Staff.cs</code> and enforce <code>ModelState.IsValid</code>.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Implement Record Editing (Step 04):</strong> Create <code>Pages/Staff/Edit.cshtml</code>, bind the entity route ID, preserve primary keys via hidden inputs, and safely update records.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Implement Safe Deletion (Step 05):</strong> Build a two-step confirmation workflow in <code>Pages/Staff/Delete.cshtml</code> to ensure destructive actions require explicit POST confirmation.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Add User Feedback (Step 06):</strong> Display flash alert notifications across redirects using <code>TempData["SuccessMessage"]</code>.
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</div>

<h2>Lab Learning Modules</h2>
<div class="demo-grid">
    <div class="demo-card">
        <div class="demo-card-header">
            <span class="step-pill pill-teal">Step 01</span>
            <h3>CRUD Overview &amp; the PRG Pattern</h3>
        </div>
        <p>
            Explore core CRUD concepts, understand why web applications distinguish GET and POST, and learn how the Post-Redirect-Get (PRG) pattern prevents duplicate form submissions.
        </p>
        <a href="https://github.com/mustbebuilt/razor-lab3-cruding/wiki/01.-CRUD-Overview-and-the-PRG-Pattern" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Read Step 01 Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="demo-card">
        <div class="demo-card-header">
            <span class="step-pill pill-teal">Step 02 &amp; 03</span>
            <h3>Inserting Data &amp; Validation</h3>
        </div>
        <p>
            Construct strongly typed forms using <code>asp-for</code> Tag Helpers. Apply Data Annotations to enforce validation rules on names, emails, and salaries with helpful user feedback.
        </p>
        <a href="https://github.com/mustbebuilt/razor-lab3-cruding/wiki/02.-Inserting-Data-Creating-Records" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Read Step 02 Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="demo-card">
        <div class="demo-card-header">
            <span class="step-pill pill-amber">Step 04</span>
            <h3>Editing &amp; Updating Records</h3>
        </div>
        <p>
            Build dedicated edit views parameterized by route ID (<code>{id:int}</code>). Preserve primary key state across POST requests and update database entities safely.
        </p>
        <a href="https://github.com/mustbebuilt/razor-lab3-cruding/wiki/04.-Editing-Data-Updating-Records" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Read Step 04 Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="demo-card">
        <div class="demo-card-header">
            <span class="step-pill">Step 05 &amp; 06</span>
            <h3>Safe Deletion &amp; Flash Feedback</h3>
        </div>
        <p>
            Enforce safe two-step delete operations that prevent accidental data loss. Provide intuitive user feedback using <code>TempData</code> flash messages following successful operations.
        </p>
        <a href="https://github.com/mustbebuilt/razor-lab3-cruding/wiki/05.-Deleting-Data-Safe-Deletion" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Read Step 05 Guide &rarr;</a>
    </div>
</div>
